ur might have changed between 2.4.1 and 2.4.2.\r\n\r\nRunning 6.0.302, because it's looking like this behaviour might also be minor-version sensitive.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/2572/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/2572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]